; --- Reading an image document (OCR) -----------------------------------
; A scanned book is pictures of text. Windows itself can read them, so this
; costs nothing to ship; what it costs is TIME, about half a second a page,
; which is why the reader is asked first rather than having a book start
; recognising itself.
